abstract: >-
  A human-led, transparently AI-assisted framework for moral reasoning under radical difference,
  including a philosophical archive, constitutional charter, decision procedure, evaluation rubric,
  and adversarial scenarios for testing value generalization, agency, non-domination, moral
  uncertainty, and coexistence.
